1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,031
Remember that grey crescent.

2
00:00:02,031 --> 00:00:06,992
It marks the future back of the frog, and fixes its whole body axis.

3
00:00:06,992 --> 00:00:17,148
Finally the sperm's pronucleus, with thirteen chromosomes, fuses with the egg's, also thirteen: a diploid zygote of twenty six.

